# Spotify — optional. Without it the Music tab says "Not set up" and the rest
# of the game is unaffected.
#
# 1. Create an app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard
# 2. Add its Redirect URIs. Spotify requires HTTPS, with ONE exception: the
#    loopback ADDRESS. It must be the IP literal — "localhost" is rejected.
#
#      http://127.0.0.1:5173/     for `npm run dev`
#      https://your.site/path/    wherever you deploy it
#
#    So in development, open http://127.0.0.1:5173/ rather than localhost, or
#    the redirect will not match. The game derives its redirect URI from
#    whatever origin it is served from, so that is all it takes.
# 3. Copy the Client ID in below. It is NOT a secret: the game is a static
#    bundle with nowhere to keep one, which is exactly why it authenticates
#    with PKCE. Never put the Client SECRET in here.
#
# Two limits are Spotify's, not the game's:
#   - Playback of any kind requires Premium, in the browser and on a remote
#     device alike. Free accounts can sign in and read playlists, and every
#     call that would make a sound returns 403.
#   - A new app is in development mode: only the accounts you add by email in
#     the dashboard can sign in, up to 25, until you request an extension.

VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
